# Common Tools Used

### VirusTotal
Used to:
- Check file reputation
- Verify malicious URLs
- Analyze hashes

### Any.Run
Interactive malware analysis sandbox used to:
- Observe malware behavior
- Analyze phishing payloads

### Joe Sandbox
Automated malware analysis platform used for:
- Dynamic malware analysis
- Threat intelligence gathering

### URLScan.io
Used to:
- Analyze websites
- Detect phishing pages
- Inspect domain behavior

